  "summary": "A distinguished Vietnamese ceramic tradition known for its distinctive blue-and-white pottery and innovative glazing techniques.",
  "description": "Features elegant forms with intricate cobalt blue decorations on white backgrounds, often incorporating floral motifs, landscapes, and calligraphy. Developed along the Red River as a major center of ceramic production, blending Chinese ceramic traditions with Vietnamese indigenous designs and local clay properties.",
